cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IndexSail in research, please cite this software."
title: "IndexSail: Reproducible BM25 Retrieval Experiments"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Yan"
    given-names: "Weiping"
    alias: "appleweiping"
version: 0.14.1
date-released: 2026-09-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/appleweiping/IndexSail"
url: "https://github.com/appleweiping/IndexSail"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic safe-Rust toolkit for bounded collection ingestion, canonical
  forward and positional inverted indexing, BM25 ranking, exact WAND, block-max
  WAND, and MaxScore execution, collection-wide physical sharding, CIFF v1
  interchange, bounded document-ID reordering, TREC-style batch evaluation,
  and reproducible retrieval reports.
